// Title: Failed Code Integrity Checks
// ID: 470ec5fa-7b4e-4071-b200-4c753100f49b
// Status: stable
// Level: informational
// Author: Thomas Patzke
// Date: 2019-12-03
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1027.001
// Description: Detects code integrity failures such as missing page hashes or corrupted drivers due unauthorized modification. This could be a sign of tampered binaries.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

any where (((winlog.event_id == 5038 or winlog.event_id == 6281)) and not ((((param1 like "*_\\CSFalconServiceUninstallTool_*" or param1 like "*_\\Program Files\\CrowdStrike\\*" or param1 like "*_\\System32\\drivers\\CrowdStrike\\*" or param1 like "*_\\Windows\\System32\\ScriptControl64_*")) or (param1 like "*_\\Program Files\\Sophos\\*"))))
